  "prose": {
    "s01": "We are joined in communion and venerate the memory, first of all, of the glorious ever Virgin Mary, Mother of God and our Lord Jesus Christ;",
    "s02": "and also blessed Joseph, Spouse of that same Virgin,",
    "s03": "and of Your blessed Apostles and Martyrs: Peter and Paul, Andrew, James, John, Thomas, James, Philip, Bartholomew, Matthew, Simon, and Thaddeus;",
    "s04": "Linus, Cletus, Clement, Sixtus, Cornelius, Cyprian, Lawrence, Chrysogonus, John and Paul, Cosmas and Damian;",
    "s05": "and all Your saints; grant, by their merits and prayers, that we may be fortified in all things with the aid of Your protection.",
    "s07": "Through the same Christ our Lord. Amen."
  },
  "narrative": {
    "s06": "The priest joins his hands."
  },
