    "prose": {
      "s02": "Therefore, O Lord, we, Your servants, and likewise Your holy people, mindful of the blessed Passion of the same Christ, Your Son, our Lord, of His Resurrection from the dead, and of His glorious Ascension into heaven:",
      "s03": "offer to Your excellent majesty, from Your own gifts and all that You have bestowed upon us,"
    }
